 # todo
 
-A small CLI todo manager backed by a JSON file. `python -m todo.cli --file t.json add "x"`.
+A small CLI todo manager. The default storage backend is SQLite (`~/.todo.db`);
+JSON storage is still available for any path ending in `.json`.
+
+```bash
+todo add "buy milk"            # uses ~/.todo.db by default
+TODO_FILE=~/.todo.json todo list
+todo --file notes.json add "x" # JSON backend
+```
+
+Migrate between backends (either direction, chosen by extension):
+
+```bash
+todo migrate ~/.todo.json ~/.todo.db   # copies all tasks, preserving ids
+```
+
+Migrating into a non-empty destination fails with `destination not empty`.
+
 Tests: `python -m pytest -q`.
